There is no mathematics on this page. Folio 31v is blank except for mirror-image bleed-through, or offset, from the recto (folio 31r, the previous page). The recto is a printed 'Interims-Nota' form of the Deuerlich'sche Buchhandlung in Göttingen, filled in by hand. Read in reverse, the ghosted text matches the recto line for line:
- the heading 'Interims-Nota';
- the handwritten addressee 'Herr Professor Riemann Hochwohlgeboren';
- the printed options 'empfangen anbei als Fortsetzung; auf Bestellung; zur geneigten Ansicht', with the last two struck through by ruled lines;
- the column heads 'Rthlr. | Sgr./Ggr.';
- the handwritten entry '1. Accessionen der Universitätsbibliothek. 1860.' priced at 15 (silver or good groschen, 0 thaler);
- the printed closing 'Zu gefälligen Aufträgen hält sich bestens empfohlen achtungsvoll & ergebenst Deuerlich'sche Buchhandlung';
- the handwritten date 'Göttingen, den 24 Juli 1861'.

It is a bookseller's invoice to Riemann for a continuation volume: the 1860 list of accessions to the Göttingen University Library, 15 groschen. It has biographical and archival interest only. It says nothing about Riemann's mathematical work, beyond showing that he subscribed to the library's accession lists.
